        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step-box">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <div class="step-title">Capability Discovery</div>
          <div class="step-desc">AOHP scans available services across API, CLI, and GUI channels. It finds: JD product-search API, Taobao GUI export (scraped via Structured UI), Amazon product API. Each capability gets input/output schemas and policy labels.</div>
