        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step-box">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <div class="step-body">
          <div class="step-title">Service Graph Construction</div>
          <div class="step-desc">Capabilities are connected into a workflow: parallel search across all three → normalize attributes → apply budget/delivery filter → rank by user preference. Purchase submission is marked as a policy-guarded state-changing action requiring explicit confirmation.</div>
          <div class="step-code">graph = parallel(search) → normalize → filter → rank → [confirm] → purchase</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step-box">
        <div class="step-num">4</div>
        <div class="step-body">
