<p>The gains concentrate in the task categories AOHP was designed for. Event capture tasks (Category 3) benefit from the notification buffer — the agent no longer misses transient SMS OTPs or timer alerts. Multi-source retrieval tasks (Category 4) benefit from parallel background execution and structured UI, which replace sequential app-switching with parallel queries. Hybrid cross-capability tasks benefit most of all: they compose the primitives from all categories, and every interface-efficiency improvement compounds.</p>

