<p>As an open fork of AOSP, AOHP is designed to be a research testbed, not a shipping product. The current limitations are explicit: compatibility coverage is incomplete for apps with custom rendering or anti-automation logic; capability discovery still requires developer-provided annotations for new apps; and the resource scheduling for virtual displays and sandbox runtimes has not been optimized for battery and thermal constraints. Each of these is a tractable systems research problem — and having an open, reproducible harness is the prerequisite for making progress on them.</p>
</section>

<!-- Listen-friendly content -->
<div class="listen-friendly-content" style="display: none;" aria-hidden="true">
  <div lang="en">
    <h2>Audio Summary: AOHP — The Agent-Native OS</h2>
    <p>Today's mobile operating systems were designed for human users: fixed app interfaces, sequential foreground execution, and permission models that track app boundaries rather than data flows. AI agents running on these systems must navigate pixel-by-pixel through GUIs designed for fingers, miss transient notifications, and expose sensitive data through their context windows.</p>
    <p>AOHP — the Android Open Harness Project — proposes treating AI agents as first-class OS actors. It retrofits Android with three primitives: personalized service composition, which generates unified cross-app task entrances on demand; efficient agent interfaces, providing four access modes from raw APIs to structured UI with dramatically different token costs; and secure information flow, which replaces sensitive plaintext with vault tokens before data ever reaches the agent context. On 30 real-world mobile tasks, AOHP raised task completion from 54.44% to 75.56%, cut token consumption by over half, and passed all five information-flow security checks.</p>
  </div>
  <div lang="zh">
    <h2>语音摘要：AOHP — 面向智能体的原生操作系统</h2>
    <p>今天的移动操作系统是为人类用户设计的：固定的应用界面、串行的前台执行、以及以应用边界而非数据流为粒度的权限模型。运行在这些系统上的AI智能体必须像人类一样逐像素导航GUI，会错过瞬时通知，并将敏感数据暴露在上下文窗口中。</p>
    <p>AOHP（Android开放智能体平台）提出将AI智能体作为操作系统的一等公民。它为Android增加了三项原语：个性化服务组合（按需生成跨应用任务入口）、高效智能体接口（提供从原始API到结构化UI四种访问模式，token开销差异显著）、以及安全信息流（在数据进入智能体上下文之前用金库令牌替换敏感明文）。在30项真实移动任务上，AOHP将任务完成率从54.44%提升至75.56%，token消耗减少超过一半，五项信息流安全检测全部通过。</p>
